  "requirements": [
    "Preserve exact source role/member ownership, canonical Self, signatures, declared bounds, flags and feature/impl restrictions.",
    "Function-pointer evidence excludes function items, closures, references and raw pointers; actual caller assumptions and ordinary impl selection remain distinct.",
    "Address conversion never invokes the pointed-to function. Retain actual signature, ABI/safety, ordinary caller/borrow/const proof, one evaluation and genuine generic/reified method behavior.",
    "Unknown, reserved, completed and imported roles remain distinct. General transport is required and old unencoded profiles must fail."
  ],
